# REMEDIATION (repo hygiene, 2026-09-07): a food/exercise-library
# data-curation pipeline's scratch inputs/outputs -- LLM audit batches,
# extraction scripts, intermediate merged datasets. Working files for
# that effort, not part of the shipped app (nothing under backend/src,
# frontend/src or admin/src reads any of these). Ignored so they stop
# showing as untracked noise in every `git status` and can't be swept
# into a commit by an unrelated `git add -A` -- several are multi-MB.
# Not deleted: if this pipeline becomes a permanent, real tool, move it
# into its own directory (e.g. tools/data-audit/) with its own README
# and un-ignore it deliberately there, rather than leaving it loose at
# the repo root either way.
